Recommends: flatpak
Suggests: python3-apt
Description: Lightweight Qt software store for APT and Flatpak
 AppGrid shows desktop applications in a screenshot grid, with search,
 install, remove, and updates. Baseline is Ubuntu 24.04 LTS (noble) and
 Debian 12 (bookworm), including Mint 22, elementary OS 8, Pop!_OS 24.04,
 and other 24.04/bookworm-based distributions. On 24.04 the UI uses PyQt6;
 on 24.10+ / Debian 13+ apt prefers split PySide6 when those packages exist.
